			"notes": "Added enhanced menu  \nAdded custom panorama render (smooth)  \nAdded custom render and overlay for mod's panorama  \nAdded Fluffy Fur button in pause screen  \nAdded custom pack selection screen (WIP)  \nAdded resource & data packs in Fluffy Fur screen (WIP)  \nAdded mouse drag scrolling in Fluffy Fur screen  \nAdded wiki link in mod description  \nAdded new configs for custom lightning bolt effect  \nAdded config for post process shader warning log  \nAdded string replacer  \nAdded Extended Standard Galactic Alphabet font  \nAdded pawscript font  \nAdded fishyyy  \nAdded handheld large centered item model  \nUpdated Fluffy Fur button icon  \nUpdated icons font  \nUpdated handheld large item model  \nUpdated handheld large rotated item model  \nFixed scrolling in Fluffy Fur menu  \nNow depth post process deactivates when player leaving world  \nNow panorama saves in instance/fluffy_fur/panorama.json  \nNow post process shaders reload when resource pack reloading  \nRain fog post process shader is now is a regular shader and renders as an overlay"
